      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Summarizes the opening of the CD4 workshop, where speakers stressed the importance of CD4 counts for antiretroviral treatment and of quality assurance. Participants were encouraged to learn about the various technologies so they could choose one suited to their infrastructure and resources.",
