    {
      "block": "library/10665-205022/blocks/prose-sec-005",
      "source": "sections/sec-005-41-country-reports.md",
      "source_hash": "11aa73473df940c92943491731565660b1b96ec704d0c428e675e2ee4338bfbd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Outlines the workshop's working methods and then reports on the status of CD4 T lymphocyte enumeration in participating countries such as Bangladesh, India, Indonesia, Myanmar, Nepal, Sri Lanka and Thailand. The country reports cover available equipment, laboratories performing counts, training and participation in quality assessment schemes. Thailand's report notes training courses run by Siriraj Hospital's centre of excellence and a national institute since 2004.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-205022/blocks/prose-sec-006",
      "source": "sections/sec-006-42-presentations-and-topics-for-discussions.md",
      "source_hash": "d1e8a0d309dae259fb1dbbd18faa3d7b46853002267d7560bdd4cd03db63cf01",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Summarizes the technical presentations at the workshop, beginning with the role of CD4 counts in HIV pathogenesis, disease monitoring and decisions on starting antiretroviral therapy. Further talks explain flow cytometry principles, gating strategies such as panleucogating, low-cost and alternative counting methods, and haematology analysers. It concludes that the choice of method should depend on test volume, staff, support and cost, with validation and proficiency testing before routine use.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
